5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should be careful about how we allocate these spaces to avoid any future friction. I'll look into the five years of association minutes and last year's complaint log entries.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to make sure everyone feels cared for and happy with the arrangement. I'll look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm curious about the money side of things! I'll check the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,"I want to understand the actual workload involved in managing this. I'll look into the sticker register and the daily riders, as well as the account from the neighbouring block's secretary.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I want to see if the complaints about the same people getting the best spots are actually true! I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders, and the five years of association minutes.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think it's wonderful that we're all taking such a thorough approach. I'm looking forward to seeing what we discover together.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm just hoping to find some actual numbers for once! It's always ""how much will it cost?"" but nobody ever knows. Let's see if the ledger actually tells us anything useful.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree that numbers are important, May, but the practical side of maintenance is just as critical. We must ensure the system we choose is actually sustainable for whoever manages it.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm just so curious to see if there's a pattern! If the same people always get the best spots, we definitely need to shake things up and make it more exciting for everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that patterns are important, Mio, but we should be careful not to create a system that encourages resentment. Let's see what the records actually show before we decide to shake things up.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It's so lovely to see everyone so passionate about this. Let's just remember to be kind to one another as we find our way to a solution that makes everyone smile.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"Kindness is great, Shizue, but a little bit of transparency about the budget wouldn't hurt either! I'll be the one to finally uncover where the money is actually going.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,"Transparency is a fine goal, May, but let's not forget that a transparent system can still fail if it's too burdensome to maintain. I'm more concerned with the long-term effort required.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I totally get that, George! But if we're too worried about the work, we might just leave things as they are, and that's no fun! I want to make sure it's fair for everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I believe we have a good balance of perspectives. I'll stick with the minutes and the complaint logs to see how past conflicts were handled.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
