22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will stick with the morning departures and the rain exposure. I hope we can find a way to make the mornings a bit more peaceful for everyone.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
